NAME='Chiron'
COVER_SUB='The wound that becomes a gift, sign by sign.'
T=[
('1969–76 · 2019–26','Chiron in Aries touches the right to exist and to act. You may have learned early that asserting yourself costs something, so anger and courage are tangled together. Here the wound is about identity, and the gift is the courage to begin again after a knock. People born in these years often become pioneers for others who feel unseen. Karmic reading: a soul learning to fight for itself without fighting everyone else. The shadow is a quick temper that hides fear, or holding back to avoid conflict. The lesson: your strength is real, and it can be gentle.'),
('1977–84 · 2027–34','Chiron in Taurus touches self-worth, the body and the feeling of having enough. You may doubt what you deserve, or cling to security because it once felt scarce. This generation grew up as questions about food, land, money and the planet moved to the front. The gift is a steady, earthy presence that helps others feel safe in their bodies. Karmic reading: a soul learning that value is not earned by what you own. The shadow is hoarding, or neglecting your own needs. The lesson: you are worth caring for as you are.'),
('1984–88 · 2034–39','Chiron in Gemini touches words, learning and being heard. You may remember not being understood as a child, or fearing that what you say is not clever enough. This generation grew up as media and information began to multiply. The gift is a voice that translates pain into language, so teachers, writers and listeners are born here. Karmic reading: a soul learning to speak its truth without needing every answer. The shadow is nervous talk, or silence. The lesson: say the simple thing; it is often the healing one.'),
('1988–91 · 2039–42','Chiron in Cancer touches belonging, the mother, and the feeling of home. You may have felt that care was uneven in your family, so you learned to nurture others early. This generation grew up as families changed shape. The gift is deep emotional intuition: you notice who is left out. Karmic reading: a soul learning to give itself the nurturing it gives to others. The shadow is over-caring or hiding behind a shell. The lesson: build a home inside you first, then invite others in.'),
('1991–94 · 2042–44','Chiron in Leo touches the heart, creativity and the fear of not being seen. You may hide your light because shining once felt unsafe, or work hard for applause that never feels enough. The gift is warmth that makes other people feel important. Karmic reading: a soul learning to be loved for who it is, not for what it performs. The shadow is pride that covers shame, or staying small to avoid attention. The lesson: your joy is a form of generosity.'),
('1994–96 · 2044–46','Chiron in Virgo touches usefulness, health and the voice that says you are never good enough. You may fix everything around you and forget yourself. The gift is skilled, practical care: healers, craftspeople and analysts come from this placement. Karmic reading: a soul learning that service is not the same as self-sacrifice. The shadow is perfectionism and worry that settles in the body. The lesson: rest and imperfection are part of a useful life.'),
('1996–97 · 2046–48','Chiron in Libra touches relationships, fairness and the fear of being alone or unloved. You may give up your own needs to keep the peace. The gift is a sense of harmony that helps others meet each other honestly. Karmic reading: a soul learning that a good partnership starts with a whole self. The shadow is people-pleasing, or choosing partners who repeat an old wound. The lesson: you can be kind and still say no.'),
('1998–99 · 2048–50','Chiron in Scorpio touches trust, power and the things we do not talk about: loss, intimacy, secrets. You may have felt betrayed or watched how much pain people hide. The gift is the ability to stay with someone in a dark place without flinching, so counsellors and investigators are born here. Karmic reading: a soul that has gone through death and rebirth and now helps others do the same. The shadow is control and suspicion. The lesson: trust can be rebuilt, slowly.'),
('1999–2002 · 2050–52','Chiron in Sagittarius touches belief, meaning and the search for truth. You may have felt let down by a teacher, a faith or a promise, and learned to look for your own answers. The gift is a wise, open-hearted guidance that helps people find their way. Karmic reading: a soul learning that faith can survive doubt. The shadow is dogma, preaching or running from commitment. The lesson: a living truth leaves room for questions.'),
('2002–05 · 2052–55','Chiron in Capricorn touches authority, responsibility and the fear of failure. You may have carried adult burdens early, or felt that you had to earn your place. The gift is quiet leadership built on lived experience: you know what it costs to carry weight. Karmic reading: a soul learning that structure should support people, not crush them. The shadow is coldness, overwork and harsh self-judgement. The lesson: success does not have to be lonely.'),
('2006–10','Chiron in Aquarius touches belonging in groups and the feeling of being the one who is different. You may have been the outsider who watched the circle from the edge. The gift is the ability to welcome the unusual and to imagine a fairer community. Karmic reading: a soul learning that being different is not a flaw but a contribution. The shadow is detachment, or rebelling against belonging itself. The lesson: you can be yourself and still be part of the whole.'),
('2011–18',"Chiron in Pisces touches boundaries, compassion and the pull of the invisible. You may feel other people's pain as your own, and look for escape when it becomes too much. The gift is a deep, wordless empathy: artists, healers and mystics come from this placement. Karmic reading: a soul at the end of a long cycle, learning to forgive and let go. The shadow is escapism, martyrdom or losing yourself in others. The lesson: compassion needs a shore to stand on."),
]
